      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "This collection contains clinical data and computed tomography (CT) from 137 head and neck squamous cell carcinoma (HNSCC) patients treated by radiotherapy. For these patients a pre-treatment CT scan was manual delineated by an experienced radiation oncologist of the 3D volume of the gross tumor volume. This dataset refers to the \"H&amp;N1\" dataset of the study published in Nature Communications (http://doi.org/10.1038/ncomms5006). At time of previous publication, images of one subject had been unintentionally overlooked. In short, the publication used a radiomics approach to computed tomography data of 1,019 patients with lung or head-and-neck cancer.",
          "descriptionType": "Abstract",
          "lang": null
        }
      ],
